1
00:00:17,790 --> 00:00:19,960
Naoya Mukai.

2
00:00:19,960 --> 00:00:24,670
A stupidly earnest, straightforward boy.

3
00:00:24,670 --> 00:00:25,960
And,

4
00:00:26,920 --> 00:00:31,720
he is my best friend—Sakisaki's boyfriend.

5
00:00:31,720 --> 00:00:33,640
Or so I thought.

6
00:00:34,220 --> 00:00:38,850
He is also dating Nagisa Minase,
who's also a classmate.

7
00:00:44,110 --> 00:00:45,520
This is clearly two-timing!

8
00:00:46,070 --> 00:00:49,490
There's no way I would accept
this kind of irregular relationship!

9
00:00:49,950 --> 00:00:54,330
Moreover, Hoshizaki from another class
also approached him.

10
00:00:55,450 --> 00:01:01,710
Mukai might be a little strange,
but I believed him to be a sincere man.

11
00:01:03,460 --> 00:01:09,760
You're not allowed to love
any other girl but Sakisaki.

12
00:01:14,550 --> 00:01:16,140
Because if you do,

13
00:01:17,350 --> 00:01:22,140
how am I supposed to give up on you,
my best friend's boyfriend?

14
00:01:24,900 --> 00:01:27,400
Huh? Sakisaki?

15
00:01:28,400 --> 00:01:30,860
Hello, Shino?

16
00:01:30,860 --> 00:01:33,990
I don't want to talk to you right now.

17
00:01:33,990 --> 00:01:37,410
Well, you know...

18
00:01:37,410 --> 00:01:38,660
What?

19
00:01:39,910 --> 00:01:41,040
If there's nothing to talk about...

20
00:01:41,040 --> 00:01:43,490
No! Shino!

21
00:01:43,490 --> 00:01:48,000
Naoya is running around naked
while sniffing Nagisa's panties!

22
00:01:51,010 --> 00:01:53,970
Are you ready to fall in
fall in love with me?

23
00:01:53,970 --> 00:01:58,130
I wanna let you know when
I have a crush on you! You!

24
00:02:00,100 --> 00:02:03,040
A throbbing development
is a maiden's desire!

25
00:02:03,040 --> 00:02:04,310
Is admiration not enough?

26
00:02:04,310 --> 00:02:06,110
It is not exciting enough!

27
00:02:06,110 --> 00:02:09,000
A beam of love that heals the world

28
00:02:09,000 --> 00:02:11,940
I want to be loved, I want to be in love

29
00:02:11,940 --> 00:02:13,350
Such ambiguous impulse

30
00:02:13,350 --> 00:02:14,700
I miss you! How about you?

31
00:02:14,700 --> 00:02:17,250
Notice my gaze

32
00:02:17,990 --> 00:02:20,910
I see the future where I am with you

33
00:02:20,910 --> 00:02:22,910
My dream is getting bigger

34
00:02:22,910 --> 00:02:26,220
The feelings I have been hiding
just popped out

35
00:02:26,220 --> 00:02:29,420
This heart of mine becomes noisy
when it is just the two of us

36
00:02:29,420 --> 00:02:34,840
Although you won't notice
since you are so dense

37
00:02:34,840 --> 00:02:41,070
I know that I am not the one
you are looking at

38
00:02:41,070 --> 00:02:44,270
Still, I cannot stop wishing for

39
00:02:44,270 --> 00:02:47,860
A love story with you

40
00:02:48,480 --> 00:02:51,690
I want to fall in love dramatically

41
00:02:51,690 --> 00:02:54,570
I want to love you romantically

42
00:02:54,570 --> 00:03:00,490
I want you to take me for real
and fall in love with you

43
00:03:00,490 --> 00:03:03,540
Choose me in a roundabout way

44
00:03:03,540 --> 00:03:06,670
Make me laugh with a happy ending

45
00:03:06,670 --> 00:03:09,670
There is a view I want to see with you

46
00:03:09,670 --> 00:03:12,460
I would rather be next to you

47
00:03:12,460 --> 00:03:14,350
Just keep that in mind

48
00:03:26,890 --> 00:03:28,900
Thank you for coming.

49
00:03:29,310 --> 00:03:31,190
Don't lie to me like that.

50
00:03:31,190 --> 00:03:32,860
We're sorry.

51
00:03:32,860 --> 00:03:37,820
Then, why should I have to help
Minase with her study?

52
00:03:39,280 --> 00:03:41,030
About that...

53
00:03:41,030 --> 00:03:44,250
(Yesterday)

54
00:03:46,000 --> 00:03:47,960
Summer break is coming!

55
00:03:48,370 --> 00:03:51,790
Summer's all about festivals,
fireworks, the beach,

56
00:03:51,790 --> 00:03:55,800
and many events for lovers
to get lovey-dovey!

57
00:03:55,800 --> 00:03:58,800
I'm not losing when it comes
to Naoya, Nagisa!

58
00:03:58,800 --> 00:04:00,760
Yes, no need to hold back!

59
00:04:00,760 --> 00:04:03,760
Naoya, are you ready?

60
00:04:03,760 --> 00:04:08,020
Saki, you know that
I've been working part-time.

61
00:04:08,020 --> 00:04:08,980
Yeah?

62
00:04:08,980 --> 00:04:10,310
At the convenience store, right?

63
00:04:10,310 --> 00:04:11,360
Do you need a bag?

64
00:04:11,980 --> 00:04:15,480
I'm willing to spend all my part-time job
earnings for this summer break!

65
00:04:15,480 --> 00:04:16,940
Naoya!

66
00:04:16,940 --> 00:04:18,700
I'll spend mine, too.

67
00:04:18,700 --> 00:04:21,530
Let's make this the best summer ever!

68
00:04:21,530 --> 00:04:22,490
Yes.

69
00:04:23,240 --> 00:04:27,410
But don't forget we have exams
before summer break.

70
00:04:28,120 --> 00:04:29,870
I just remember it.

71
00:04:30,960 --> 00:04:33,420
The exams start next week, right?

72
00:04:33,420 --> 00:04:36,840
I'm sure we can manage it with
an overnight study like always.

73
00:04:36,840 --> 00:04:39,340
Don't let your guard down, Saki!

74
00:04:39,340 --> 00:04:42,160
If you get three or more failing grades,

75
00:04:42,160 --> 00:04:45,060
you will have to take remedial classes
every day during summer break.

76
00:04:45,810 --> 00:04:49,560
If that happens, then all our plans
for the summer will be useless.

77
00:04:50,520 --> 00:04:55,110
Come on, I'm not dumb enough
to get three failing grades at once.

78
00:04:58,320 --> 00:05:00,610
I'm sorry for being dumb!

79
00:05:01,910 --> 00:05:04,200
How much have you studied so far?

80
00:05:04,200 --> 00:05:06,660
Well, about that...

81
00:05:06,660 --> 00:05:11,920
I was overly happy while doing my best
to cook and do other stuff for you.

82
00:05:12,460 --> 00:05:15,170
So I haven't studied at all.

83
00:05:20,170 --> 00:05:22,090
I'll teach you!
Let's do our best!

84
00:05:22,090 --> 00:05:24,180
Thank you!

85
00:05:24,180 --> 00:05:26,140
(Three days before the exams)

86
00:05:26,140 --> 00:05:28,850
When you have to remember the years,
put your guts into it!

87
00:05:28,850 --> 00:05:29,480
Yes!

88
00:05:29,480 --> 00:05:31,850
For English, memorize them
by writing a lot of words!

89
00:05:31,850 --> 00:05:32,560
Yes!

90
00:05:32,560 --> 00:05:36,110
For math, memorize all of the formulas
and try all of them until it works!

91
00:05:36,110 --> 00:05:37,610
Err...

92
00:05:38,320 --> 00:05:43,320
I hate to say this, but...

93
00:05:43,320 --> 00:05:46,280
Do you have any other ways
than to put guts into it?

94
00:05:46,700 --> 00:05:48,240
Sorry for being clumsy!

95
00:05:49,700 --> 00:05:52,960
Saki, can't you help me teach her?

96
00:05:56,920 --> 00:05:58,500
Saki?

97
00:05:59,380 --> 00:06:05,680
Nagisa, you said that I don't need to
hold back when it comes to Naoya.

98
00:06:06,600 --> 00:06:10,560
If Nagisa ends up taking remedial classes,

99
00:06:11,560 --> 00:06:14,520
then I'll be able to monopolize Naoya
during the summer break.

100
00:06:14,520 --> 00:06:15,520
Saki?!

101
00:06:15,940 --> 00:06:19,360
Come on, I'm just kidding.

102
00:06:19,360 --> 00:06:20,980
Let's see...

103
00:06:20,980 --> 00:06:24,740
The largest city ruins of
the Indus civilization?

104
00:06:24,740 --> 00:06:26,410
It's Roppongi Hills.

105
00:06:26,410 --> 00:06:27,070
Yes!

106
00:06:27,070 --> 00:06:28,950
Saki, don't lie to her!

107
00:06:28,950 --> 00:06:30,910
(Two days before the exams)

108
00:06:33,750 --> 00:06:36,130
At this rate, it's not good.

109
00:06:36,540 --> 00:06:39,750
If only we have someone
who is good at studying...

110
00:06:39,750 --> 00:06:40,590
Oh!

111
00:06:40,590 --> 00:06:43,920
Shino is really good at studying.

112
00:06:43,920 --> 00:06:47,550
But it's been kinda awkward ever since
she found out about the two-timing.

113
00:06:47,550 --> 00:06:49,600
Saki, we don't have any other choice!

114
00:06:49,600 --> 00:06:51,770
I don't know what to say to her!

115
00:06:53,680 --> 00:06:55,100
Don't worry.

116
00:06:55,730 --> 00:06:58,440
I'll work hard.

117
00:06:58,440 --> 00:07:01,650
It'll be my first summer
with Naoya, after all.

118
00:07:03,570 --> 00:07:08,660
There are a lot of things that
I want to do together with Naoya.

119
00:07:09,120 --> 00:07:10,530
Minase...

120
00:07:12,200 --> 00:07:13,790
Nagisa...

121
00:07:14,960 --> 00:07:17,830
That answer is super wrong.

122
00:07:19,130 --> 00:07:20,750
Saki!

123
00:07:20,750 --> 00:07:23,550
Oh well, we're out of options.

124
00:07:29,430 --> 00:07:30,970
I see.

125
00:07:30,970 --> 00:07:34,390
Then, you want me to teach Minase?

126
00:07:34,390 --> 00:07:35,430
Yes.

127
00:07:35,430 --> 00:07:38,440
Nagisa, where did you put the tea?

128
00:07:38,440 --> 00:07:40,900
It's in the rightmost drawer.

129
00:07:40,900 --> 00:07:42,860
Here, huh?

130
00:07:42,860 --> 00:07:46,860
Aren't you two a bit too familiar
with this house?

131
00:07:46,860 --> 00:07:51,240
Well, we've been living together
for around a month and a half.

132
00:07:54,500 --> 00:07:55,410
Hold on.

133
00:07:57,870 --> 00:08:01,920
You didn't know that
the three of us are living together.

134
00:08:02,710 --> 00:08:05,170
These guys!

135
00:08:05,710 --> 00:08:09,130
Hey! Is it my turn yet?

136
00:08:09,680 --> 00:08:13,600
Not only two-timing,
but you three are living together?

137
00:08:15,060 --> 00:08:18,690
I was the one who came up with it,
in order for us to get along better.

138
00:08:19,310 --> 00:08:21,020
What about your parents?

139
00:08:21,020 --> 00:08:22,770
They're never here because of work.

140
00:08:23,520 --> 00:08:29,700
A boy and two girls living together
while two-timing to get along better?

141
00:08:31,990 --> 00:08:34,700
Are the three of you doing it?

142
00:08:34,700 --> 00:08:35,660
Of course not!

143
00:08:35,660 --> 00:08:37,960
Our relationship is healthy!

144
00:08:37,960 --> 00:08:39,210
Yeah! Doing a threeso—

145
00:08:40,170 --> 00:08:42,250
is what we'd never do!

146
00:08:42,250 --> 00:08:43,960
In what way?!

147
00:08:43,960 --> 00:08:48,420
More importantly,
we want you to teach Minase.

148
00:08:48,420 --> 00:08:49,760
That is more important?

149
00:08:49,760 --> 00:08:51,180
I beg of you!

150
00:08:51,180 --> 00:08:55,180
If this goes on, we won't be able to make
fun memories during summer break.

151
00:08:55,180 --> 00:08:57,220
I couldn't care less.

152
00:08:58,560 --> 00:09:01,060
I'm trying to stop you from
two-timing on Sakisaki.

153
00:09:01,060 --> 00:09:03,900
So there's no way I'm going to help
the girl you're two-timing with.

154
00:09:04,610 --> 00:09:06,570
I'll do anything in return!

155
00:09:06,570 --> 00:09:07,320
Wha—

156
00:09:07,320 --> 00:09:09,780
Minase, lend me your phone!

157
00:09:10,820 --> 00:09:11,530
Here.

158
00:09:11,990 --> 00:09:13,660
I'll even delete this photo!

159
00:09:13,660 --> 00:09:14,240
Hey!

160
00:09:15,700 --> 00:09:16,990
See? I deleted it!

161
00:09:16,990 --> 00:09:17,660
Huh?

162
00:09:18,040 --> 00:09:20,710
If you deleted it first,
you can't use it to negotiate with me.

163
00:09:20,710 --> 00:09:22,000
Now that you mention it!

164
00:09:22,000 --> 00:09:26,960
But that means I'd be threatening you,
and I couldn't do that.

165
00:09:28,920 --> 00:09:30,300
I beg of you!

166
00:09:30,300 --> 00:09:31,090
Please!

167
00:09:31,090 --> 00:09:33,470
Shino, can you?

168
00:09:34,640 --> 00:09:38,520
This is what I don't like about you.

169
00:09:41,310 --> 00:09:44,060
Whatever! Just this once!

170
00:09:44,060 --> 00:09:46,150
Shino, you're so kind.

171
00:09:46,150 --> 00:09:46,980
How wonderful.

172
00:09:46,980 --> 00:09:47,770
Yes.

173
00:09:47,770 --> 00:09:49,190
Stop it!

174
00:09:49,650 --> 00:09:54,200
Study for exams?
Creating video content is more important!

175
00:09:55,280 --> 00:09:57,330
So, which subjects you don't understand?

176
00:09:57,330 --> 00:09:58,740
Well...

177
00:09:58,740 --> 00:10:00,580
More or less everything!

178
00:10:00,580 --> 00:10:02,290
You're that dumb?

179
00:10:02,660 --> 00:10:04,670
I'm sorry.

180
00:10:04,670 --> 00:10:06,750
Let me see your notebook.

181
00:10:08,340 --> 00:10:12,170
Well, there are lots of mistakes,
but you did good with the basics.

182
00:10:12,170 --> 00:10:14,010
Really?

183
00:10:14,380 --> 00:10:16,640
A genius who knows people's good points.

184
00:10:16,640 --> 00:10:17,890
How trustworthy.

185
00:10:17,890 --> 00:10:18,640
I love you.

186
00:10:18,640 --> 00:10:19,970
Give it a rest!

187
00:10:19,970 --> 00:10:23,690
At any rate, you have to
give your all until the exams.

188
00:10:23,690 --> 00:10:24,770
I'll do my best!

189
00:10:24,770 --> 00:10:26,900
Leave the house chores and support to me!

190
00:10:28,270 --> 00:10:30,230
I guess we will be alright now.

191
00:10:31,440 --> 00:10:34,200
First, transcribe all of my notebooks!

192
00:10:35,030 --> 00:10:36,950
Are you tired?
I can massage your shoulders.

193
00:10:36,950 --> 00:10:37,910
Stop that!

194
00:10:37,910 --> 00:10:41,040
You're making too many mistakes!
You've to cram it in by the numbers!

195
00:10:41,040 --> 00:10:42,540
Yes!

196
00:10:42,540 --> 00:10:44,330
I'm going to buy energy drinks!

197
00:10:44,330 --> 00:10:45,670
Get me some gummies too.

198
00:10:45,670 --> 00:10:47,670
Sakisaki, why are you not studying too?

199
00:10:47,670 --> 00:10:49,380
Okay, I will!

200
00:10:49,380 --> 00:10:51,840
(One day before the exams)

201
00:10:52,311 --> 00:10:54,404
Good. That part is right.

202
00:10:54,405 --> 00:10:56,072
Okay.

203
00:10:57,760 --> 00:11:01,100
You did well.
Keep going at this pace.

204
00:11:01,100 --> 00:11:03,770
Thank you very much.

205
00:11:03,770 --> 00:11:05,230
As expected of Shino.

206
00:11:05,230 --> 00:11:06,310
You're too amazing.

207
00:11:06,310 --> 00:11:07,980
Can you give it a rest already?

208
00:11:11,020 --> 00:11:17,160
You three are way too easy-going
with this two-timing thing.

209
00:11:17,160 --> 00:11:19,620
You're a really nice person, Shino.

210
00:11:19,620 --> 00:11:21,830
You know what?
I hate you!

211
00:11:23,040 --> 00:11:26,250
I'm only doing this
because Sakisaki asked me to.

212
00:11:26,250 --> 00:11:29,290
Well, Shino is a tsundere,
so it's fine.

213
00:11:29,290 --> 00:11:31,090
Cut it out, Sakisaki!

214
00:11:31,550 --> 00:11:36,470
Even if that's your reason, you're still
doing your best for the sake of others.

215
00:11:37,470 --> 00:11:41,890
I think you're a wonderful person.

216
00:11:45,390 --> 00:11:47,270
Look...

217
00:11:47,270 --> 00:11:50,730
The way you always say that kind of stuff
to everyone is what I hate about you!

218
00:11:50,730 --> 00:11:52,980
I... I'm sorry!

219
00:11:52,980 --> 00:11:56,950
(During the exams)

220
00:11:56,950 --> 00:11:59,950
I did it!

221
00:12:01,910 --> 00:12:03,200
Good for you.

222
00:12:03,200 --> 00:12:06,580
It's all thanks to you!
Thank you very much!

223
00:12:06,580 --> 00:12:07,960
Saki!

224
00:12:07,960 --> 00:12:10,380
Good for you, Nagisa!

225
00:12:11,080 --> 00:12:14,500
Even with all that studying,
your scores are the same as before.

226
00:12:14,500 --> 00:12:15,960
I'll study harder.

227
00:12:15,960 --> 00:12:19,010
Now we'll be able to make
the best summer break ever!

228
00:12:19,010 --> 00:12:19,930
Yes!

229
00:12:19,930 --> 00:12:24,010
By the way, you said that
I can ask for anything, right?

230
00:12:26,680 --> 00:12:31,440
I'm going to live with you three in your house
during the summer break.

231
00:12:33,820 --> 00:12:36,320
I'm not letting you three
do whatever you want.

232
00:12:37,650 --> 00:12:39,910
I'll just skip the remedial classes.

233
00:12:45,450 --> 00:12:49,410
You will live together with us?

234
00:12:51,080 --> 00:12:53,380
But why?

235
00:12:53,380 --> 00:12:58,090
Now that I know you're living together,
I can't just leave you be.

236
00:12:58,090 --> 00:13:01,720
To bring Sakisaki to her senses,
I'll observe you three

237
00:13:01,720 --> 00:13:05,180
and find evidence that
two-timing will never work out!

238
00:13:05,180 --> 00:13:07,140
I get it.

239
00:13:07,520 --> 00:13:11,110
So you're saying you'll point out
where we're lacking,

240
00:13:11,110 --> 00:13:14,440
and then you'll tell us
how to improve it.

241
00:13:15,360 --> 00:13:17,110
You're such a nice person.

242
00:13:17,430 --> 00:13:18,520
You're wrong!

243
00:13:18,520 --> 00:13:21,070
I'm trying to stop this two-timing!

244
00:13:21,070 --> 00:13:22,320
Oh, right.

245
00:13:22,320 --> 00:13:23,950
Good grief.

246
00:13:24,530 --> 00:13:26,240
I can, right?

247
00:13:26,240 --> 00:13:26,990
Sure!

248
00:13:26,990 --> 00:13:28,200
- Huh?
- Really?

249
00:13:30,210 --> 00:13:32,290
What's up with that?

250
00:13:32,290 --> 00:13:33,250
Mirika!

251
00:13:33,250 --> 00:13:33,920
She was there?

252
00:13:33,920 --> 00:13:37,670
You drove me out when
I was camping in your yard,

253
00:13:37,670 --> 00:13:39,880
but she got a-okay?

254
00:13:40,840 --> 00:13:42,090
Do you love her?

255
00:13:42,090 --> 00:13:43,800
You're wrong.

256
00:13:44,590 --> 00:13:51,520
If Shino watches us closely,
she'll feel we're serious about this.

257
00:13:52,060 --> 00:13:54,410
This might be the chance

258
00:13:54,412 --> 00:13:57,230
to get Saki's precious friend
to acknowledge our relationship!

259
00:13:57,230 --> 00:13:58,730
That's not fair!

260
00:13:58,730 --> 00:14:00,440
You don't have anything
to do with this!

261
00:14:00,440 --> 00:14:02,110
I'm going to live with you, too!

262
00:14:02,110 --> 00:14:03,320
You can't!

263
00:14:08,790 --> 00:14:13,790
If I can't, then nobody's going to
get inside Naoya's house!

264
00:14:13,790 --> 00:14:16,750
What are you talking about?!

265
00:14:22,220 --> 00:14:24,470
